        <p>PETF.II WALRE t tt SON. LVALTED (WLRRINGYON BREWERY 7. BuaroN Btu:water' ) —This math was played a, Warring- ton on Saturday last, mad resulted in an easy win for the home club. Both teams were entertained at the Lion Hotel to luncheon and tea, after which a " smoker" was held under the able chairmanship of Mr. James Monro, head brewer to the firm. Score :</p>
