        <p>Total l2O Total Bl EARLESToWN V. LlvEnPooL.—The return fixture was played at Aigburth on Saturday. The bowling of Alderson Was most destructive, and with Liverpool out for a small score. the prosoects of Barlestown were of the best. Reads and Crowther made an excellent stand, the former cartying his bat through for a well played 23 Huish also hit out well and his score of 23, was made in a very short time. Crowther was unfortunately run out. and with the collapse or the others, Barlestown lost by 12 runs, score:</p>
