      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-07-07_WidnesExaminer_art0081" n="art0081">
        <p>LIST OF WEEK-DAY DESPATCHES. Showing the time to which a Letteir cto 1.” pt el with Ordinary Postage, and with an Extra Halfpenny Stamp. 1 a.m.—Newton-le-Willows</p>
        <p>2-16 a.m.—Wigan 4-0 a.m.—Widnes, Appleton, Farnworth, Ditton, Penketh, Preston Brook, Prodsham, Heisby, Daresbury,and Moore 5-30 a.m .—Lymm, Thelwall. Newchurch 5-45 am Grappenhall, Heatley Heath, Croft, Pad gate. Stockton Heath, Stretton, Warburton, and Wools ton 6-15 a.m.—For Town Delivery and Latchford 9-0 a.m.—Manchester, Bolton, Oldham, Macclesfield, Stock - port, Buxton, Yorkshire, Northumberland, Durham, and S.E. Lancashire. 9-30 a.m.—London, Southern and South-Western Counties, Central. South Wales, and Foreign, and St. Helens 9-45 a.m.—Liverpool, Birkenhead, Southport, aad the Isle</p>
