        <p>A WORD TO THE WISE. The fickle nature of the climate of this country often gives rise te a variety of ailments and cOrnplaints,which dsiuming at first the form of only a slight indisposition, neglected and unheeded may b ceme the germ of serious diseases which will undermine the constitution, and finally result in a long and lingering illneEs.and per- haps terminate fatally. The variable temperature and the changeable weather of the last month pr so, makea it incumbent on all of us to exorcise wie and prud( nt precautions to counteract the evil effects which the weather may have had upon our health and eomfort. Alreaciy we frequently hear such complaints as " No appetite." " Th-se frequent headaches," " This 1- n- gold feeling," and dozens of other expressions which al point to the urgent need of a good Tonic. Now tt re are several tonic mixtures offered te the Public, W Hone which have been so uniformly successful as Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters, The Vegetable Tonic. This preparation is acknowledged to be The Best Remedy of the Age for Nervousnss, Weakness, Chest Affections, Palpitation of the Heart, Indigestion, Liver Complaint, and Influenza. The numerous cases of marvellous cures effected, and the restoration to perfect health, of those who had long suffered and had vainly tried other remedies, can be accounted for by simply s ating the effect which Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters has upon the System. Ist. It strikes at the source of the disease, and by removing the auses of disease, the evil effects soon vanish. 2nd. It strengthens that part of the system which is weakest, and therefore, most liable to the attack 3 of colds and all diseases. 3rd: It purifies the blood, and thus gives new life and force to all parss of the body, for disease cannot exist where there is a free circulation of pure blood. 4th. It gives healthy action to the digestive organs. and to the liver, thus aiding to keep away Indigestion, and the host of different forms of disease which result rom it. sth. By removing impurities,strengthening the weak parts of the systens, and purifying the blood, the human frame is well fortified to withstand the attscks of dli- ease. It is repelled, and its place taken by health and strength, through the effective action of Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters, The Vegetable Tonic. Sold everywhere in betties 2s. 91. and 4s. 61. each, or will be sent car- riage free for these prices, direct from the Sole Proprie- tors :—Quinine Bitters Manufacturing Company, Limited,Llanelly, South Wales. Beware of Imitations. See that you get the genuine Preparation with the name, "Gwilym Evans" on Label, Stamp, and Bottle, without which none is genuine.</p>
